Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1383.999,993.999)}That girl's shoes\Nare cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(68.001,388.002)}I wish I could\Nwin the lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(405.999,899.001)}Why won't she text me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1578,1028.001)\fs60}I need a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(472.002,985.998)}I ate too much yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(387.999,1002)}Ooh, she really {\i1}does {\i0}like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1564.002,1002)}I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs60\pos(1358.004,1014.003)}I think my back tooth\Nis hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\pos(367.998,1017)}Hey, don't step on my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1353.999,1037.001)}I'm staying\Nhome tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(63.999,1024.002)}Aw, I wish I had\Nmy license.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aww, I wish I was more popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:28.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}All right, my horoscope says I'll have\Na great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:31.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, that boy looks cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm able to read people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:39.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or more precisely,\NI hear what they're thinking\Nas though they were telling a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything people want\Nto know is written in my blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to eat my fill of meat today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've named this power "Monologue."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I haven't told anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If people\Nfound out, I'd be ostracized by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because no one would be comfortable\Nwith having someone else\Nknowing what they're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.45,0:01:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I lied and told\Nthe others that my dumb parlor trick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,of being able to stick one-yen coins\Nto my forehead was my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:13.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't revealed this power to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:17.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one else has found out about it yet,\Nnor does anyone even suspect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have total confidence in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, after all,\NI know what everyone else is thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:30.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I got here a little too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe that was a bit too quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:59.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But now, I'll get a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After we left, we went\Naround to a few other worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:08.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and successfully finished\NMs. Aki's summer camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.37,0:02:13.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We had a bit of a bumpy road,\Nbut we must have completed what\Nshe called her "compulsory education."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were all dismissed,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:20.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and at the end, we were given\Nthe rank of Private 5th Class,\Nand an invitation to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I no longer had any reason to stay\Nwith him, and was terribly bummed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I really like Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our being able to finish our camp today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is the result of Ms. Aki's\Nintensive instruction and guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:48.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As was our rubbing elbows with\Nfriends with whom we can work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:52.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The bonds we have fostered here\Nwill never be outdone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}...and are precious treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've ended up being nobody at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We will carry these experiences\Nwe gained at summer camp
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:03:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}with us for the rest of our lives,\Nand always embrace this camaraderie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:59.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can boast over the others\Nis my perfect attendance award.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going to become of me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.23,0:03:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been recognized by God, right?\NYou're in the elite course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are awesome, Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're proud to have been\Nin the same class as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:14.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watching everyone\Nbuttering me up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it feels good, but at the same time,\Ndisconcerting somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The simpleton thinks he's so hot.\NFall on your face, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't being\Nentirely truthful, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're just saying what\Nwould sound nice to anyone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's okay. I'm not like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't mean apples and oranges, either;\Nmore like the toilet bowl and its turds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's on another roll today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the real Asakaze,\Nthe one that only I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His story is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.99,0:03:55.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you think of my speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not\Nvery good at these things...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, she's so cute today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty soon,\Nwe won't see each other anymore.\NCome on, declare your feelings for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I'm too afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:10.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should ask her out first—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't bear to watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm no different than Kaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:30.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somehow, he finds me off-putting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:34.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you've been in touch\Nwith Nozomi recently, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:42.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like\NI'm interested in her, or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is she doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sure miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She can't even do anything, but I'll\Nbet she's still acting high and mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asakaze is in love with Nozomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since we first went adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:05:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She seems fine.\NApparently, she's on Hateno Island\Nwith Nagara and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara! That scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because of what he said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I need a favor from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you help me with my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just looking for a chore girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's one of those types. I've never\Nseen anyone ask her to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:22.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When she hears she can be helpful to\Nsomeone, she'll be delighted easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering what path to\Ntake next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure I can help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She must really like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, but\Nshe's not the one I want to attract.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:40.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to answer right away.\NGive it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's stubborn, and selfish,\Nand a little ill-natured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange, isn't it? It stings\Na little every time I talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I like Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:05:59.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since we first went adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't your power at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what you get for\Nbeing pushy, you ugly gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:11.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the chosen one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look down on {\i1}me {\i0}all this time, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't have anyone not doing what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey now, this is a super-funny face\Nyou're making, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:25.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost, get lost! And don't\Never enter my sight again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.51,0:06:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-How mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:35.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is she with Nagara, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm {\i0}the one who's protecting everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi, look at {\i1}me{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:51.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same person I was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be thrilled\Nif I show this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave her to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:11.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just want to keep Nozomi safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just going to keep\Nslowing everyone else down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:22.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way, Nozomi will reevaluate me,\Nand why she turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:22.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know the real me, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be... better if\Nshe didn't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:34.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asakaze's unrequited love\Nmust have ended in heartbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:44.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see him being an outcast from\Nthe world someday, becoming isolated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:44.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and then finally landing at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fantasize about that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:51.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I know that Asakaze would never\Ncome to me, because he thinks I'm ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Not unless the world changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's something I know\Nbetter than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So if I can at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Aki's boobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's taking Asakaze down the wrong path.\N{\an1}She's taking Asakaze down the\Nwrong path
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't think of Asakaze as anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's only interested in his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, this is such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He should get away\Nfrom her, fast! For sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is currently someone who\Njeopardizes the existence of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need you to put a stop to War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is something that no one else\Nhas ever been able to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:55.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to create\N"death" in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:04.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because we are static people,\Nwe can't move forward any farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all have nothing to do,\Nnor anything we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know where the trains are going,\Nwhat roles we've been given,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or even who our enemies\Nare supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All we do have here is\Na vague sense of insecurity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not supposed to die, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Asakaze thinks that\Nhe can change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's obsessed with\N"a great task that only I can do."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm not able to change Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:52.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Each of the three cats has\Ntheir own role that they play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:56.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tora places the orders,\NGen transports them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:10:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Sakura copies the things\Nbeing brought from your own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Including living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sakura, make another me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter? Make another—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The cats must have\Ntheir own sense of ethics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They know that if they\Nuse their powers recklessly,\Nthey will create unnecessary tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, so, does this mean that she is\Nthe one behind our castaway copies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:35.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But just as with\NNagara's creating worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.64,0:10:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she was only unconsciously involved\Nin the phenomenon happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then what about you, Mizuho?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.34,0:10:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.03,0:10:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... What {\i1}have{\i0}\NI been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:11:00.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rajdhani didn't take into\Naccount the cats' feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:05.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why he didn't pick up\Non Mizuho's own personal potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're being held captive by a drift\Nthat has already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mizuho's power...\N...may have something to do\Nwith our being in stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you had known about this at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the outcome might have\Nturned out differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I might go together with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been curious about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you hated smartphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an}Mm-hmm, yeah, I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nozomi was the only one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...who treated the others\Nwithout any deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I follow my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:32.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's what I believe, so it's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Nozomi can get Asakaze to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Been waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:45.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Nozomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're disrupting my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:03.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but Nozomi is here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you go with Ms. Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to go put down\Na bad guy to ensure world peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:12.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are amazing, Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.31,0:13:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, would you bring us along with you\Nwhen you put down this bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd like to see you in action.\NNozomi, you would, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:27.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You would, too, {\i1}right{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be dangerous for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.35,0:13:36.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, the one\NI'm taking down is "War."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.53,0:13:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,War...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:44.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is "War," is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That horrible woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.89,0:15:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy is War?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:03.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:09.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:11.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dinner...\N...should about be ready, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:30.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:32.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been acting strange\Never since the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:45.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about a short break?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This sure is a dull world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where could War be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.63,0:16:55.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do\Nwhen you find War?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill him\Nbecause he's War?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no police or military force here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone has to do it. That someone is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't even know what War is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, creating death?\NYou think you've become God or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:19.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you even know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because that girl can see\Nright through all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She has the power to\Nread other people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How I feel? What I'm thinking right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:44.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.94,0:17:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, were they laughing at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:17:59.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I adjust the scale,\NI can hear her voice quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Using my power relativistically, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:52.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.99,0:18:55.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those are more power holdovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, I got them from Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are just perfect for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This gorge really does seem like\Na deep wound cut into the world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:12.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. It coincides with\Nwhat Yamabiko said about War, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But is this War even taking place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was wondering that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the train station,\NI overheard a lot of voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but none of them knew anything about War.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:44.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have to use any powers\Nto know what's in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and mock me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:49.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who do you think made it\Npossible for you to even be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.49,0:19:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true even now.\NYou could at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to tell you\Nwhy I turned you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:58.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because I can't respect you.\NThat's why I can't go out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, including God,\Nacknowledges me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:07.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not about everyone else. It's about\Nwhat {\i1}you {\i0}decided you were worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.24,0:20:08.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I am dead,\NI can accept my own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.23,0:20:17.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could never be as strong as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:22.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't acknowledge who I was,\Nother than the power I was given.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could never be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why I kept pursuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, that ends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi really was the only one\Nwho could change Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll be the one\Nto show you the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's put an end to this "War."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who\Ncan conquer {\i1}This {\i0}World.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:02.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were chosen by {\i1}This {\i0}World.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing but a huge\Nwound remaining here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's spent too much time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's put a stop to it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:36.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:38.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.77,0:21:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't even peer that\Ndeeply into your own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asakaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:22:00.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fruit of a\Nspontaneously-occurring power...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:03.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:15.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I knew the real Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.64,0:22:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The right chicken is the one you ordered,\Nand the left one is the one I asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mizuho didn't want to see anyone die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.19,0:22:51.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have {\i1}oyako donburi {\i0}tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.91,0:22:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The least we can do is eat her.
